    <region left="0" top="1458" width="768" height="68" color="#000000" fontSize="10">
      <text lang="eng" width="768" fontFamily="Arial" fontSize="10">
        <content>
          <p>
            <span style="font-weight: bold;">Give the manufacturer and complete orderable part number for each replacement. Use manufacturer data to check tolerances, Q, self-resonance and suitability at 5.8 GHz. State the frequency of each Q value you use.</span>
            <br />
            <span style="font-weight: bold;">Include capacitor losses and internal parasitics. State where your model values came from and whether the models cover 5.8 GHz. Explain the difference between component Q and loaded circuit Q.</span>
          </p>
        </content>
      </text>
    </region>
